#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Vas a probar control PWM real sobre un candidato para \"{label}\". Un canal "
"a la vez, con el equipo a la vista y sin trabajo sin guardar abierto. "
"Primero sube a 100% (sin riesgo de apagado en ninguna placa), luego baja "
"brevemente a {low}% para confirmar que sigue girando, y se restaura "
"automático al terminar — la misma secuencia que ya validaste a mano."
msgstr ""
"You are about to test real PWM control on a candidate for \"{label}\". One "
"channel at a time, with the machine in view and no unsaved work open. First "
"it rises to 100% (no shutdown risk on any board), then briefly drops to {low}"
"% to confirm it keeps spinning, and restores to automatic when done — the "
"same sequence you already validated by hand."

