"✅ PWM write permission installed (dedicated group, it8792/it8620 only).\n"
"Log out and back in for your group membership to take effect.\n"
"This does NOT enable Reactive by itself — it remains a separate switch, and "
"only writes to channels you test and confirm one by one."

